at https://github.com/anthropics/skills/tree/main/skills/frontend-design
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The same skill ships as the Claude Code
frontend-design plugin (https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/tree/main/plugins/frontend-design),
whose README and plugin.json name its authors as Prithvi Rajasekaran and
Alexander Bricken.

The upstream material has been modified, condensed and combined with Dainer's
own guidance. The original frontend-design files are not reproduced verbatim
in this repository.

This public repository (github.com/Rebelzxr/fable-forge) is Dainer's published
version of Fable Forge. See CHANGELOG.md for the changes made for public use.
